2026-11-02T02:25:03.3052815Z  Description: Data token killer: a Claude Code hook that turns big tables, CSV, JSON and
2026-11-02T02:25:03.3053675Z   JSONL tool output into lean summaries. Works with rtk.
2026-11-02T02:25:03.3054551Z   dtk is a Claude Code hook. It finds big tables in command output (CSV, JSON,
2026-11-02T02:25:03.3055502Z   JSON lines, logfmt, access logs, polars and psql tables) and replaces them with
2026-11-02T02:25:03.3056350Z   a short summary that covers every row. It works with rtk.
